    "identifier": "akimichi-body-fat-cushion",
    "description": "<p>You expand your body like a balloon reducing damage by cushioning impacts. You gain the following until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Immunity to Bludgeoning, Earth and Cold damage</p>\n<p>Resistance to all other damage types, except Mental, Lightning and Piercing damage until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Expansion Crash. You can expand in size fast enough, and large enough to protect your allies. All allied in a 10-foot radius gains the benefit of this jutsu until the end of the current turn.</p>",
